title: Corked
text: A red wine, and not a drop of blue in it. The cellar has run out of corks, so you will have to improvise.
trick: a lone teleporter swallows any beam with no partner ahead: the cork in the neck stops blue, and on its diagonal it is also the far end of red's tunnel into the bottle
motif: pictogram: a bottle with a three-wide neck, half full, in a wine rack
expect: depth>=3
